      "start_seconds": 0.76,
      "end_seconds": 7.3,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "Mm, doctor, hi, where would you like me to put my coat?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.66,
      "end_seconds": 12.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.32,
      "text": "not at all, please sit what seems to be wrong?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.92,
      "end_seconds": 27.2,
      "duration_seconds": 12.28,
      "text": "Honestly, it's bright red blood on the paper, and my family pushed me to come. Work has been very busy so I kept ignoring it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 28.11,
      "end_seconds": 30.54,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 31.09,
      "end_seconds": 35.27,
      "duration_seconds": 4.18,
      "text": "Mm, it's been two days, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.99,
      "end_seconds": 40.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.42,
      "text": "Any itching around your bottom as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 41.69,
      "end_seconds": 45.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.36,
      "text": "yeah, I've had that since last night"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 46.01,
      "end_seconds": 48.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.51,
      "text": "Is there something that settles it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.02,
      "end_seconds": 57.92,
      "duration_seconds": 8.9,
      "text": "A cream helps a bit oh, and hard stools that's been about the same, about four days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 59.96,
      "end_seconds": 63.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "So, how troublesome is it it day to day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 65.9,
      "end_seconds": 67.6,
      "duration_seconds": 1.7,
      "text": "Severe, I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.89,
      "end_seconds": 69.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.52,
      "text": "Okay, go on."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 82.32,
      "end_seconds": 84.41,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Anything surgical in your history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.31,
      "end_seconds": 90.62,
      "duration_seconds": 5.31,
      "text": "Yes, I had keyhole surgery on my gallbladder, two years back."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.73,
      "end_seconds": 105.03,
      "duration_seconds": 4.3,
      "text": "What conditions have you been treated for in the past?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.57,
      "end_seconds": 107.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "I have low haemoglobin."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 112.0,
      "end_seconds": 114.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "now some background about your lifestyle"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.38,
      "end_seconds": 129.69,
      "duration_seconds": 13.31,
      "text": "I gave up cigarettes last spring. I work in accounts at a hospital. My husband and I live above the shop. I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 130.47,
      "end_seconds": 133.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.18,
      "text": "Do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 134.76,
      "end_seconds": 137.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "Iron tablets, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.77,
      "end_seconds": 151.15,
      "duration_seconds": 4.38,
      "text": "Have you had any dizziness or change in bowel habit?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 152.51,
      "end_seconds": 157.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.24,
      "text": "Let me think, you know, nope, nothing like that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 158.38,
      "end_seconds": 163.84,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "Right, have you had any black stools, weight loss or severe pain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 165.7,
      "end_seconds": 172.1,
      "duration_seconds": 6.4,
      "text": "I, I haven't had black stools, weight loss or severe pain, no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 174.02,
      "end_seconds": 177.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "how are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 179.11,
      "end_seconds": 180.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.61,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 182.77,
      "end_seconds": 186.97,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "can I check a few measurements before we carry on?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.4,
      "end_seconds": 199.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "bear with me while this finishes.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 218.89,
      "end_seconds": 227.97,
      "duration_seconds": 9.08,
      "text": "Okay: temp 36.8 degrees, pulse 75, respiratory rate 17, saturation 98 percent, BP is 120 over 71."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.52,
      "end_seconds": 230.05,
      "duration_seconds": 1.53,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.04,
      "end_seconds": 235.41,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 237.2,
      "end_seconds": 239.19,
      "duration_seconds": 1.99,
      "text": "Shall I start the examination?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.06,
      "end_seconds": 244.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Take a a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 251.66,
      "end_seconds": 260.99,
      "duration_seconds": 9.33,
      "text": "there is a small soft lump at the edge of the anus and no tear that I can see"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.84,
      "end_seconds": 279.95,
      "duration_seconds": 13.11,
      "text": "you can sit up now from what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with haemorrhoids at this stage a polyp in the bowel is also on my list"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.47,
      "end_seconds": 284.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I mean, is this serious, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.33,
      "end_seconds": 304.11,
      "duration_seconds": 18.78,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now haemorrhoids is my leading thought, not anything worse. Stop me if I've got anything wrong. You've had bright red blood on the paper for two days, and no severe pain or dizziness"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.81,
      "end_seconds": 307.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "That's what happened, yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 309.05,
      "end_seconds": 340.78,
      "duration_seconds": 31.73,
      "text": "I'm going to order a blood count, for rectal bleeding i'd like you to take haemorrhoid cream, twice a day, for a week it's for haemorrhoids fibre, plenty of water, and don't sit on the toilet for long do get help quickly if the bleeding gets heavier or you feel faint i'll want another look in four weeks that's everything on my side anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.84,
      "end_seconds": 344.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.83,
      "text": "erm, thank you, doctor, goodbye"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.8,
      "end_seconds": 350.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.6,
      "text": "have a good day"
    }
  ]
